The Serializable interface
Serializable





  &reftitle.intro;

   Legacy interface for custom serialization through the serialize() and
   unserialize() methods; new code uses __serialize() and __unserialize()
   instead.


   This page is only a summary; the full documentation is in the PHP manual:
   Serializable.





